<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" articleSchema={true} datePublished="2026-01-15" dateModified="2026-08-19" description="Learn what data Acupressure Guide collects, how it is used and protected, your privacy rights, and how to contact us. Last updated August 19, 2026." breadcrumbs={[{ label: "Home", href: "/" }, { label: "Privacy Policy", href: "/privacy-policy/" }]}>
<article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 lg:px-6"><h1 class="mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1><p class="text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400 text-lg mb-8">Your privacy is important to us. This policy explains how Acupressure Guide collects, uses, and protects your personal information. Last updated: August 19, 2026.</p>

<section id="information-we-collect" class="mb-8"><h2 class="mb-4">What Information Do We Collect?</h2><p class="mb-3">We collect three categories of information when you visit our site: usage data, contact data, and cookies. We collect only the minimum needed to run the site and respond to you.</p><h3 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">Types of data we collect</h3><ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-300"><li><strong>Usage data:</strong> Pages visited, time spent on pages, browser type, and device information</li><li><strong>Contact information:</strong> If you email us, we may collect your email address and any information you choose to include</li><li><strong>Cookies:</strong> We may use cookies to improve your browsing experience</li></ul></section>

<section id="how-we-use-information" class="mb-8"><h2 class="mb-4">How Do We Use Your Information?</h2><p class="mb-3">We use your information for four purposes: improving content, analyzing traffic, responding to inquiries, and maintaining security. We never sell your personal information.</p><h3 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">Our four uses of your data</h3><ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-300"><li>Improve our content and user experience</li><li>Analyze site traffic and usage patterns</li><li>Respond to inquiries and provide support</li><li>Maintain site security and functionality</li></ul></section>

<section id="third-parties" class="mb-8"><h2 class="mb-4">Do We Share Information with Third Parties?</h2><p class="mb-3">We do not sell or share your personal information with third parties. We may use third-party analytics services (such as Google Analytics) to help understand how visitors use our site.</p><h3 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">Analytics providers</h3><p>These services may collect information about your browsing activity. We do not sell or share your personal information with third parties.</p></section>

<section id="data-security" class="mb-8"><h2 class="mb-4">How Do We Protect Your Data?</h2><p class="mb-3">We take reasonable measures to protect your information from unauthorized access, alteration, or disclosure. However, no method of transmission over the internet is completely secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.</p><blockquote class="border-l-4 border-forest-500 pl-4 italic text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-300 my-4"><p>"Personal data shall be processed in a manner that ensures appropriate security of the personal data, including protection against unauthorised or unlawful processing and against accidental loss, destruction or damage."</p><cite class="not-italic text-xs text-stone-500">— General Data Protection Regulation, Article 5(1)(f). <a href="https://gdpr-info.eu/art-5-gdpr/" rel="noopener" target="_blank" class="text-forest-600 underline hover:text-forest-500">GDPR-info.eu</a></cite></blockquote></section>

<section id="your-rights" class="mb-8"><h2 class="mb-4">What Are Your Privacy Rights?</h2><p class="mb-3">You have four privacy rights: access, update, delete, and opt out of cookie tracking. You can exercise any of them by contacting us.</p><ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-300"><li><strong>Access:</strong> request a copy of the personal information we hold about you</li><li><strong>Update:</strong> correct inaccurate or outdated information</li><li><strong>Delete:</strong> ask us to remove your personal information</li><li><strong>Opt out:</strong> disable cookie tracking through your browser settings</li></ul></section>

<section id="children" class="mb-8"><h2 class="mb-4">Do We Collect Data from Children?</h2><p class="mb-3">No. Our site is intended for a general audience, and we do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13 years of age.</p></section>

<section id="changes" class="mb-8"><h2 class="mb-4">How Will You Know About Policy Changes?</h2><p class="mb-3">We may update this privacy policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated revision date, and we encourage you to check this page periodically to stay informed about how we handle your information.</p></section>

<section id="contact" class="mb-8"><h2 class="mb-4">How Do I Contact You About Privacy?</h2><p class="mb-3">For any privacy question, request, or concern, email us at <a href="mailto:hello@acupressured.com" class="text-forest-600 dark:text-forest-300 hover:underline">hello@acupressured.com</a> and we will respond as soon as possible.</p></section>
</article>
